      <title>2026.07.25.a3f88b8</title>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <h3>Automatic updates are here</h3>
        <p>First release with built-in updates &mdash; tokenbank now updates itself in place.</p>
        <ul>
          <li><b>New:</b> Automatic updates (Sparkle). Background checks and one-click install, cryptographically signed. Manual check in Settings &rarr; General &rarr; Check Now.</li>
          <li><b>Fixed:</b> Settings window (General / Accounts / Log) no longer opens cramped or clipped, sizes correctly, and shows a proper title.</li>
        </ul>
        <p style="color:#888">Signed (Developer ID: Archaitect B.V.) and notarized. Requires macOS 14+ and Claude Code.</p>
      ]]></description>
